  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is a non-zero polynomial of degree four, having local extreme points at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo></math> then the set <math><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>}</mo></math> contains exactly",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
